From: guille-vega <guillermo.vega@balena.io>
Subject: spl: imx: Authenticate the FIT FDT at the address it is signed for

With CONFIG_IMX_SPL_FIT_FDT_SIGNATURE the SPL authenticates the FIT FDT
with HAB in the place where the loader read the header to. HAB requires
the IVT to be at the address it declares, which is the one the FIT is
loaded to from SD/MMC, so the authentication fails for the loaders that
read the header somewhere else. That is the case of the stream loader
used when booting over USB, which reads it from the CONFIG_SPL_IMX_ROMAPI_LOADADDR
buffer.

Move the header to the address its IVT declares before authenticating it,
as it is done later for the signed images. Nothing changes when the header
is already there.

Signed-off-by: guille-vega <guillermo.vega@balena.io>
---
 arch/arm/mach-imx/spl.c | 22 ++++++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 20 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm/mach-imx/spl.c b/arch/arm/mach-imx/spl.c
--- a/arch/arm/mach-imx/spl.c
+++ b/arch/arm/mach-imx/spl.c
@@ -406,9 +406,29 @@
 	if (IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_IMX_HAB)) {
 		if (IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_IMX_SPL_FIT_FDT_SIGNATURE)) {
 			u32 offset = ALIGN(fdt_totalsize(fit), 0x1000);
+			u32 fdt_size = offset + 2 * CSF_PAD_SIZE;
+			struct ivt *fdt_ivt = (struct ivt *)((uintptr_t)fit +
+							     offset + CSF_PAD_SIZE);
 
-			if (imx_hab_authenticate_image((uintptr_t)fit,
-						       offset + 2 * CSF_PAD_SIZE,
+			/*
+			 * The FIT FDT is signed for the address its IVT declares, which
+			 * is the one the FIT is loaded to from SD/MMC. The loaders that
+			 * read the header to another place, as the stream one used when
+			 * booting over USB, have to move it there for HAB to be able to
+			 * authenticate it.
+			 */
+			if (fdt_ivt->hdr.magic == IVT_HEADER_MAGIC) {
+				void *signed_fit = (void *)(uintptr_t)(fdt_ivt->self -
+								       (offset + CSF_PAD_SIZE));
+
+				if (signed_fit != fit) {
+					memcpy(signed_fit, fit, fdt_size);
+					fit = signed_fit;
+					tmp = (u8 *)fit;
+				}
+			}
+
+			if (imx_hab_authenticate_image((uintptr_t)fit, fdt_size,
 						       offset + CSF_PAD_SIZE)) {
 #ifdef CONFIG_ANDROID_SUPPORT
 				printf("spl: ERROR:  FIT FDT authentication unsuccessful\n");
